    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d473">

                <pb facs="0497" n="325" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg325"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/6711</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Stimson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-09-13T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 13, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department desires to be informed by cable as to number and whereabouts of all
                    interned German vessels in Argentine Republic, <pb facs="0498" n="326"
                        xml:id="pg326"/> together with short description. You should instruct all
                    consuls to cooperate with Embassy to that end.</p>
                <p>As complete and up to date report as possible is also desired as to number and
                    size of merchant vessels flying Argentine flag.</p>
                <p>Report also as to whether Argentine Government allows neutral shipping to pass
                    under Argentine flag and affords same protection to that shipping as to shipping
                    of Argentine ownership.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
